c Minimal instance demonstrating watched literals soundness bug
c 
c This instance should be SATISFIABLE (e.g., 1=T, 2=F, 3=F, 4=F, 5=T, 6=T)
c but watched literals propagation incorrectly returns UNSAT or finds invalid model
c 
c Root cause: Watch replacement logic finds "replacements" on literals with
c stale value=false from previous assignments after backtracking.
c 
c Expected behavior with linear propagation: SATISFIABLE
c Buggy behavior with watched literals: UNSAT or invalid model
p cnf 6 5
1 2 3 0
4 5 6 0
-1 -4 0
-2 -5 0
-3 -6 0
